# Model weights (.cache/) and datasets (data/) stay local: scripts 01 and 02
# download the datasets, and the first Gemma run downloads the model.
.cache/
data/
# outputs/: the logs, metrics, predictions, each run's history.json and its
# best/adapter_config.json are committed. The adapter weights (140 MB each,
# *.safetensors at the repo root), per-epoch checkpoints and PEFT model cards stay local.
**/outputs/adapters/*/epoch-*/
**/outputs/adapters/**/README.md
**/outputs/human_eval/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
